# RAG and LLM modules

- Chunks carry `source` and `jobId`. Retrieval filters to resume + selected job before ranking.
- Resolve target job from `"Job N"` in the question, then `selectedJobId`.
- Rebuild the in-memory session store after resume replace or job add. Do not persist uploads to disk.
- `observe.ts` logs chat events. Do not add a metrics vendor.
- Keep `src/types.ts` as the single types file for Document, Chunk, Citation, ChatRequest/Response, Llm.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — dump every job into the prompt
complete(resumeText + allJobs.join("\n") + question)

// ✅ GOOD — retrieve, then generate
const retrieval = await retrieveForJob(store, { query, selectedJobId }, llm);
const answer = await generateAnswer(query, retrieval, llm);
```
